TEXT 1000 -336 Left 2 !*\n.param Gfc=-10 ; magnitude at crossover *\n.param PS=-90 ; phase lag at crossover *\n*\n* Enter Design Goals Information Here *\n*\n.param fc=1k ; targeted crossover *\n.param PM=60 ; choose phase margin at crossover *\n*\n*\n* Enter the Values for Vout and Bridge Bias Current *\n*\n.param Vout=12\n.param Ibias=250u\n.param Vref=2.5\n.param Rpullup=10k\n*\n* Enter opto characteristics *\n*\n.param Fopto=15k\n.param Copto={1/(2*pi*Fopto*Rpullup)}\n.param CTR=1\n*\n.param VL=2.5 ; min TL431 voltage\n.param VCEsat=0.3 ; Opto sat voltage\n.param Vdd=5 ; pull-up resistance bias\n.param Vf=1 ; LED forward voltage\n.param  A={Vout-Vf-VL}\n.param B={Vdd-VCEsat}\n.param Rmax={(A/B)*Rpullup*CTR}\n*\n*\n* Do not edit the below lines *\n*\n.param Rlower={Vref/Ibias}\n.param Rupper={(Vout-Vref)/Ibias}\n* .param boost={PM-PS-90}\n.param boost=70\n.param G={10**(-Gfc/20)}\n.param kf={tan((boost/2+45)*pi/180)}\n*\n* Pole-zero calculation\n*\n* .param fp={fc*kf}\n* .param fz={fc/kf}\n.param fp={(tan(boost*pi/180)+sqrt((tan(boost*pi/180))**2+1))*fc}\n.param fz={fc**2/fp}\n*\n.param RLED={CTR*Rpullup/G}\n.param C1={1/(2*pi*fz*Rupper)}\n.param C2={1/(2*pi*fp*Rpullup)}\n.param Ccol={C2-Copto}\n*
TEXT 552 -360 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k
TEXT -56 432 Left 2 ;Type 2 compensator\nTL431 + optocoupler\nManual pole-zero placement\n \nChristophe Basso
TEXT 104 992 Left 2 ;The dc labels are the values of the components:\npV --> pF\nnV --> nF\nkV --> kOhms
TEXT -376 1064 Left 2 ;Check RLED is always smaller\nthan RMAX otherwise regulation\ncan be lost. Trying to regulate\nat low Vout brings issue. Opening \nthe fast lane is a viable solution.
